	(text "Sound: PA6 (TIM3_CH1 PWM) -> S8050 low-side switch on +5V.\nFront: 12 mm PASSIVE buzzer through R3.  Back: optional 8 ohm speaker on J3\nthrough R4.  Fit either or both.  D1 catches the coil kick.\nFirmware Sound_Stop() parks PA6 low, so the transistor idles OFF."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 172.72 0)
